{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ride as world champion and MTB legend Sam Pilgrim, using an advanced trick system to bust out insane combos across 40+ hand-crafted levels designed to capture the \u201cflow\u201d of mountain biking.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With zero BS getting between you and the action, <strong>Shred! 2</strong> can be a quick \u201cone more go\u201d session or a deep dive into longer shredding runs. It\u2019s an addictive, authentic MTB experience where every inch of trail pushes you to the limit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Created out of pure passion for the sport by a solo developer, <strong>Shred! 2 delivers one of the most genuine MTB gameplay experiences out there.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Ride &amp; Customise bikes...lots of Bikes!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ride official Canyon bikes, including the Stitched 360, Stitched 720, Spectral, Torque, and Sender! Plus unlock a whole range of custom creations\u2014from clean modern builds to full-on ridiculous contraptions. Ever wanted to launch a mini bike off a cliff? Or tailwhip a tandem? Now you can. Sam the man would be proud.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/853200/extras/58cc40d2b77ab1cefd8f73be042196da.avif?t=1764800116\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/853200/extras_big/58cc40d2b77ab1cefd8f73be042196da.webp?t=1764800116 width=1560 height=1508 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Over 40 levels &amp; 200 unique challenges</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on 40 hand-crafted levels spanning diverse MTB disciplines, including Downhill, Slopestyle, and Street riding <strong> inspired by MTB culture, riding destinations, events and video segments!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ride across the UK, USA, the High Alps, and \u201c<strong>The Zone</strong>\u201d \u2014 a blatant excuse to push physics and level design to the absolute limit, where even gravity is occasionally optional!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/853200/extras/78e8d7dc68406f8b2c0ecc4544f55ac7.avif?t=1764800116\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"icon":"81a3164eb8f459c994ced4c6201d1921fb2c6e0b.jpg","localized_name":"Ready To Ride","name":"Ready To Ride","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/853200/81a3164eb8f459c994ced4c6201d1921fb2c6e0b.jpg"},{"icon":"544effcc163d61b300b22d1def4c55a36e878650.jpg","localized_name":"Alpine Master","name":"Alpine Master","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/853200/544effcc163d61b300b22d1def4c55a36e878650.jpg"},{"icon":"b95b241770849d67692ec0fffe0ce1f6f42678bf.jpg","localized_name":"Rule Britannia","name":"Rule Britannia","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/853200/b95b241770849d67692ec0fffe0ce1f6f42678bf.jpg"},{"icon":"cef000bfa213d9165bf567c3d7001d8a53002076.jpg","localized_name":"Stars And Stripes","name":"Stars And Stripes","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/853200/cef000bfa213d9165bf567c3d7001d8a53002076.jpg"},{"icon":"6fbb0c6aab82b8be2fc75933b3e39fcff00176ed.jpg","localized_name":"Mini Bike ","name":"Mini Bike ","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/853200/6fbb0c6aab82b8be2fc75933b3e39fcff00176ed.jpg"},{"icon":"af5c03f373156b66172e0f2c35bb1274fed637c0.jpg","localized_name":"Shred 1 Classic","name":"Shred 1 Classic","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/853200/af5c03f373156b66172e0f2c35bb1274fed637c0.jpg"}